      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡No puedo creer que hayas logrado ahuyentar\na esos Beldum! ¡Muchas gracias!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕř",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ahora, por fin podremos volver a usarlo...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕř",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410068006F00720061002C00200070006F0072002000660069006E00200070006F006400720065006D006F007300200076006F006C0076006500720020006100200075007300610072006C006F002E002E002E00100002011401590000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡¿Cómo?! ¡¿Volvieron?!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕř",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1740,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100BF004300F3006D006F003F0021002000A100BF0056006F006C0076006900650072006F006E003F002100100002011401590000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Uf... ¿Por qué siempre me pasa todo a mí?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕř",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00550066002E002E002E002000BF0050006F007200200071007500E90020007300690065006D0070007200650020006D00650020007000610073006100200074006F0064006F002000610020006D00ED003F00100002011401590000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Pasa algo, Tadeo?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1888,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF005000610073006100200061006C0067006F002C00200054006100640065006F003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Ah, jefe! B-bueno, mírelo usted...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕř",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100410068002C0020006A006500660065002100200042002D006200750065006E006F002C0020006D00ED00720065006C006F002000750073007400650064002E002E002E00100002011401590000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Ay, esos Beldum! Mira qué acurrucaditos\nque están.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2008,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100410079002C002000650073006F0073002000420065006C00640075006D00210020004D00690072006100200071007500E9002000610063007500720072007500630061006400690074006F0073000A007100750065002000650073007400E1006E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Los Beldum están hechos de imanes y se atraen\npor las ondas electromagnéticas que generan<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nlos Holotransportadores. En otras palabras...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2112,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 139
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Buen trabajo, Tadeo. Esto prueba claramente que\nel Holotransportador vuelve a funcionar a pleno<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nrendimiento. En fin, me vuelvo a mi puesto.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 2392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 143
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Así que les atrae el Holotransportador que\nacabo de reparar...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕř",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 2680,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041007300ED00200071007500650020006C0065007300200061007400720061006500200065006C00200048006F006C006F007400720061006E00730070006F0072007400610064006F00720020007100750065000A0061006300610062006F00200064006500200072006500700061007200610072002E002E002E00100002011401590000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Beeel!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 2816,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10042006500650065006C00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ahora que lo pienso, si los tuviera conmigo,\nsabría enseguida cuando están estropeados.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕř",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 2832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡No se diga más! ¡Me los quedo a todos\ncomo compañeros!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕř",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3016,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004E006F002000730065002000640069006700610020006D00E100730021002000A1004D00650020006C006F007300200071007500650064006F0020006100200074006F0064006F0073000A0063006F006D006F00200063006F006D0070006100F100650072006F0073002100100002011401590000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
